[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16922.15, "timestamp": "04:42:02", "text": "一切，而且，我越是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16926.15, "timestamp": "04:42:06", "text": "以前经常来小溪边。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16930.628, "timestamp": "04:42:10", "text": "这已经是好几年前的事了，但是，嗯，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16933.19, "timestamp": "04:42:13", "text": "嗯，我当时在他们的办公桌旁，但我做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16935.91, "timestamp": "04:42:15", "text": "挂出。他们不像 Discord 那样使用 Discord。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16937.99, "timestamp": "04:42:17", "text": "VC之类的东西很多，所以它只存在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16940.39, "timestamp": "04:42:20", "text": "以前每天都会有人来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16943.35, "timestamp": "04:42:23", "text": "用于获取VIP徽章。他们记得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16946.47, "timestamp": "04:42:26", "text": "我的名字，一切，即使在之后，就像如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16949.39, "timestamp": "04:42:29", "text": "即使在我处于不活跃状态之后也是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16959.19, "timestamp": "04:42:39", "text": "呃，就像呃，即使过了一年，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16962.628, "timestamp": "04:42:42", "text": "东西，不，他们嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16964.788, "timestamp": "04:42:44", "text": "呃，一年了之类的，不，他们仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16966.75, "timestamp": "04:42:46", "text": "还记得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16969.868, "timestamp": "04:42:49", "text": "诸如此类的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16974.948, "timestamp": "04:42:54", "text": "但是，但是就像我的问题不是像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16978.15, "timestamp": "04:42:58", "text": "我觉得我跟你说得对。"}]